    "## Q3. How do you determine the optimal values for the epsilon and minimum points parameters in DBSCAN clustering?\n",
    "## Answer "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "845061ff-ff77-46d1-be83-6d8c58d9d48d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### How to Choose MinPts :\n",
    "#### 3Rule of thumb:\n",
    "- Set MinPts ≥ D + 1, where D is the number of dimensions in your data.\n",
    "- For 2D data, MinPts is often set to 4 or more."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bd41902a-2e9e-413d-bf62-aac2da506d73",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
